      "updated": 1776251574258,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4) Binary training loop (Gryffindor vs all)\n\nInit: w=0, b=0\nFor each epoch:\n  z = X @ w + b\n  p = sigmoid(z)\n  loss = log_loss(y, p)\n  error = p - y\n  grad_w = (X.T @ error)/m\n  grad_b = mean(error)\n  w = w - lr*grad_w\n  b = b - lr*grad_b",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 194,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4) Binary training loop (Gryffindor vs all)\n\nInit: w=0, b=0\nFor each epoch:\n  z = X @ w + b\n  p = sigmoid(z)\n  loss = log_loss(y, p)\n  error = p - y\n  grad_w = (X.T @ error)/m\n  grad_b = mean(error)\n  w = w - lr*grad_w\n  b = b - lr*grad_b",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a9",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
